<sn><md>#### Alternative: Ubuntu package

You can also install it through APT:

```bash
sudo apt update
sudo apt install rclone
```

Then:

```bash
rclone version
```

**Recommendation:** Use the **official installer** if you want the latest Rclone version. The Ubuntu repository version may be older.

[Official Rclone installation guide](https://rclone.org/install/)
